{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `z`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that each parameter prior (`rho`, `alpha`, `a`, and `eta`) is stated before any use of the corresponding parameter in deterministic computations or likelihood terms. This preserves the same posterior/log density. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"// Fit the hyperparameters of a latent-variable Gaussian process with an
// exponentiated quadratic kernel and a Bernoulli likelihood

data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] real x;
  array[N] int<lower=0, upper=1> z;
}
transformed data {
  real delta = 1e-9;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> rho;
  real<lower=0> alpha;
  real a;
  vector[N] eta;
}
model {
  vector[N] f;

  rho ~ inv_gamma(5, 5);
  alpha ~ normal(0, 1);
  a ~ normal(0, 1);
  eta ~ normal(0, 1);

  {
    matrix[N, N] L_K;
    matrix[N, N] K = gp_exp_quad_cov(x, alpha, rho);

    // diagonal elements
    for (n in 1 : N) {
      K[n, n] = K[n, n] + delta;
    }

    L_K = cholesky_decompose(K);
    f = L_K * eta;
  }

  z ~ bernoulli_logit(a + f);
}
